{"seq":7,"slug":"lc0329-longest-increasing-path","title":"LeetCode 329 矩阵中的最长递增路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-graph-advanced/lc0329-longest-increasing-path","wordCount":862,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-329-矩阵中的最长递增路径\">LeetCode 329 矩阵中的最长递增路径</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个 <code>m x n</code> 的整数矩阵 <code>matrix</code>，找出其中<strong>最长递增路径</strong>的长度。对于每个单元格，可以向上、下、左、右四个方向移动，<strong>不能对角线移动或移动到边界外</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>m == matrix.length</code></li>\n<li><code>n == matrix[i].length</code></li>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= m, n &lt;= 200</code></li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= matrix[i][j] &lt;= 2^31 - 1</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：matrix = [[9,9,4],[6,6,8],[2,1,1]]&#10;输出：4&#10;解释：最长递增路径为 [1, 2, 6, 9]。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：matrix = [[9,9,4],[6,6,8],[2,1,1]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：最长递增路径为 [1, 2, 6, 9]。</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：matrix = [[3,4,5],[3,2,6],[2,2,1]]&#10;输出：4&#10;解释：最长递增路径为 [3, 4, 5, 6]。注意不允许对角线移动。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：matrix = [[3,4,5],[3,2,6],[2,2,1]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：最长递增路径为 [3, 4, 5, 6]。注意不允许对角线移动。</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：matrix = [[1]]&#10;输出：1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：matrix = [[1]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：1</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题要在矩阵中找最长的<strong>严格递增</strong>路径。每个位置可以向四个方向移动，目标格的值必须严格大于当前格。</p>\n<p><strong>暴力 DFS：</strong> 从每个格子出发进行 DFS，尝试所有递增方向。最坏情况下时间复杂度为指数级，因为同一个格子会被不同路径重复计算。</p>\n<p><strong>记忆化 DFS（最优解）：</strong> 关键观察——从格子 <code>(i, j)</code> 出发的最长递增路径长度是<strong>固定的</strong>，不会因为从不同起点到达而改变。因此可以用记忆化存储每个格子的结果。</p>\n<p>定义 <code>memo[i][j]</code> 为从 <code>(i, j)</code> 出发的最长递增路径长度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"memo[i][j] = 1 + max(memo[ni][nj])&#10;其中 (ni, nj) 是 (i, j) 的四邻居且 matrix[ni][nj] &gt; matrix[i][j]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>memo[i][j] = 1 + max(memo[ni][nj])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>其中 (ni, nj) 是 (i, j) 的四邻居且 matrix[ni][nj] > matrix[i][j]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>为什么不会有循环依赖？因为路径是<strong>严格递增</strong>的，不可能回到已经走过的格子（值更大的格子不可能回到值更小的格子）。这保证了递归一定会终止。</p>\n<p><strong>拓扑排序 + BFS（替代解法）：</strong> 将矩阵看作 DAG（有向无环图），每个格子向值更大的邻居连边。从所有入度为 0 的节点（局部最小值）开始 BFS，层数就是最长路径。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[两种解法]&#10;    A --&gt; B[记忆化 DFS]&#10;    A --&gt; C[拓扑排序 BFS]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[对每个格子 DFS]&#10;    B1 --&gt; B2[递归计算四邻居]&#10;    B2 --&gt; B3[缓存结果到 memo]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[建图 + 计算入度]&#10;    C1 --&gt; C2[入度 0 的格子入队]&#10;    C2 --&gt; C3[BFS 层层扩展]&#10;    C3 --&gt; C4[层数即最长路径]\">graph TD\n    A[两种解法]\n    A --&gt; B[记忆化 DFS]\n    A --&gt; C[拓扑排序 BFS]\n    B --&gt; B1[对每个格子 DFS]\n    B1 --&gt; B2[递归计算四邻居]\n    B2 --&gt; B3[缓存结果到 memo]\n    C --&gt; C1[建图 + 计算入度]\n    C1 --&gt; C2[入度 0 的格子入队]\n    C2 --&gt; C3[BFS 层层扩展]\n    C3 --&gt; C4[层数即最长路径]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力 DFS</td>\n<td>指数级</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记忆化 DFS</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>最优，代码简洁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拓扑排序 BFS</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>迭代式，无栈溢出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>记忆化 DFS：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function longestIncreasingPath(matrix: number[][]): number {&#10;  const m = matrix.length;&#10;  const n = matrix[0].length;&#10;  const memo: number[][] = Array.from({ length: m }, () =&gt; new Array(n).fill(0));&#10;  const dirs = [&#10;    [-1, 0],&#10;    [1, 0],&#10;    [0, -1],&#10;    [0, 1],&#10;  ];&#10;&#10;  const dfs = (i: number, j: number): number =&gt; {&#10;    if (memo[i][j] !== 0) return memo[i][j];&#10;&#10;    let maxLen = 1;&#10;    for (const [di, dj] of dirs) {&#10;      const ni = i + di;&#10;      const nj = j + dj;&#10;      if (ni &gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; ni &lt; m &amp;&amp; nj &gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; nj &lt; n &amp;&amp; matrix[ni][nj] &gt; matrix[i][j]) {&#10;        maxLen = Math.max(maxLen, 1 + dfs(ni, nj));&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    memo[i][j] = maxLen;&#10;    return maxLen;&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  let result = 0;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; m; i++) {&#10;    for (let j = 0; j &lt; n; j++) {&#10;      result = Math.max(result, dfs(i, j));&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> longestIncreasingPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">matrix</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> m</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> matrix.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> matrix[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> memo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ length: m }, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dirs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dfs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (memo[i][j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> memo[i][j];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxLen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</sp